Session 12: Into the Shadowfell

The party entered the Shadowfell through the portal in Ravenloft's crypt.
They met Test Character 1, an elven ranger who offered to guide them.

In the Raven Queen's temple, they learned of a plot by Test Character 2
to overthrow her. Test Character 1 revealed she's secretly allied with Test Character 3.

The party accepted a quest to retrieve the Soul Shard from the Fortress
of Eternal Night.